msgid "BuddyPress Activity Social Share"
msgstr ""

#: admin/wbcom/class-wbcom-admin-settings.php:135
msgid ""
"This plugin allows anyone easily share BuddyPress Activites on major social "
"media (Facebook, Twitter, Google+, Linkedin )."
msgstr ""

